Modifications to the vendored code (three, all small):
  GlobalVariables.java - path fields made non-final and a relocate(...) method added, so the
    plugin can keep its files inside plugins/AutoModpack4Paper/.
  NettyServer.java     - the TLS context is built from a PrivateKey and X509Certificate objects instead of
    PEM files, so Netty's optional BouncyCastle PEM reader is never used.
  NetUtils.java        - added loadPrivateKey / loadCertificateChain (JDK-only PEM parsing) for the above.

